/- File: SessionMultiLib/Topology.lean

  The session half of the topology.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.Topology's dependencies from Session, SessionLibrary (Card,
  Iter and the files they load) and SessionMultiLib (Misc, Vectors,
  Determinants, Metric), and exports every theorem by name.  Importing this
  module is `needs "Multivariate/topology.ml"`: its own `needs` are the
  imports below, and each bundle is built by `initialize` when the module is
  loaded, in file order.
-/

